php-vm calls proposal 0002: dynamic calls and callables (zend_init_dynamic_call_string/_array,
zend_fcall_info_init, zend_forbid_dynamic_call). Applies after 0001. Files: call.rs, fiber.rs, enums/callable.rs.

- `$f()` follows INIT_DYNAMIC_CALL. "A::m" (last `::`) and ["A", "m"] go through
  zend_std_get_static_method and never bind $this, so a non-static method (including a `__call`
  trampoline) gives "Non-static method A::m() cannot be called statically".
  [$obj, "parent::m"] is not special. Error texts: "Array callback has to contain indices 0 and 1",
  "Second array member is not a valid method", "Value of type %s is not callable", and
  "Call to undefined function bar()" without the leading `\`.
  Fixes dynamic_call/bug63173, dynamic_call_non_static, dynamic_fully_qualified_call.
- Internal callers (call_value / call_value_named: call_user_func(_array), array_map, ...) and the
  Fiber constructor resolve through zend_is_callable (resolve_callable_value). This gives
  `self::`/`parent::`/`static::` and ["C", "parent::m"] callables, and $this for non-static methods
  of the calling class. The dynamic-call path is the fallback for errors.
  Fixes dynamic_call/bug48770, bug48770_2, bug48770_3, bug78898, magic_methods/bug45186,
  bug45186_2, tests/classes/abstract_user_call.
- call_builtin checks a pure `callable` / `?callable` parameter once with zend_is_callable(v, false),
  as Z_PARAM_FUNC does. The "Use of "self" in callables" and `Callables of the form ["C", "parent::f"]`
  deprecations fire at argument-parsing time, and autoload runs only once.
  Fixes tests/classes/autoload_012.
- enums/callable.rs: the static-method fallback in zend_is_callable_check_func tries $this's `__call`
  before `__callStatic`, like get_static_method_fallback. call_user_func('BAR::www') from inside a
  BAR instance goes to __call (magic_methods/bug45186).
- A dynamic call of extract/compact/get_defined_vars/func_get_args/func_get_arg/func_num_args
  (@forbid-dynamic-calls) runs a copy of the builtin whose handler throws "Cannot call %s()
  dynamically" after argument parsing. This needs no PendingCall/Frame layout change.
  Fixes dynamic_call/dynamic_call_005, 006, 008.

